      <h1 class="article__title" data-pagefind-meta="title">GTA 6 Editions and Prices: Standard vs Ultimate (2026)</h1>
      <p class="article__meta">
        <span class="article__updated">Last updated <time datetime="2026-11-18" data-pagefind-meta="updated[datetime]">18 Nov 2026</time></span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span class="article__published">Published <time datetime="2026-11-18">18 Nov 2026</time></span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span>5 min read</span>
      </p>
      <p class="article__byline">By <span class="article__author">Leonida Guides Team</span> <span class="article__ai">· Written with AI help and fact-checked against the cited sources.</span> <a class="article__ai-link" href="/about/">How we work</a></p><p class="article__lead">GTA 6 costs $79.99 Standard and $99.99 Ultimate, with UK and euro prices, upgrade info, GTA+ month and the Vintage Vice City Pack bonus explained.</p>
      <span hidden data-pagefind-filter="spoilers">Spoiler-free</span>
      <span hidden data-pagefind-filter="category">Launch Hub</span>
    </header>

    <div class="article__layout">
      <aside class="article__toc toc" aria-label="On this page" data-pagefind-ignore>
